    "detailed_description": "Friends World is a single and multiplayer strategy defense game made for VR.<br>Friends World is a game created using Kakao Friends' IP. You can experience everything in virtual reality, including various characters, game battles, and various stages and backgrounds.<br><br>Save the 'FRIENDS' who are stained with evil! Rescue the hero stained with evil, rescue the hero, and use that hero to attack all stages!<br><br>1. Deck Setting<br> - Users can create a deck by selecting 'FRIENDS' characters. You can challenge single and multiplayer using your own deck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361340/extras/de75804c354c3e4b2993e08ddc4850ac.avif?t=1682388219\" /></span><br><br>2. Single game<br> - 20 different stages are available. There are 4 bosses in 20 stages, and we plan to continuously add stages through future updates.<br> - You can play a mini-game by throwing gifts and coins before selecting a stage. Gifts can acquire items with a low probability, and coins can acquire CON.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361340/extras/6de5d27fe9727e39f2454a325552a35a.avif?t=1682388219\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361340/extras/2f57dd49da4486641f45ef4915cb2d99.avif?t=1682388219\" /></span><br><br>3. Multi game<br> - You can play invite friends, random 1:1, and Battlefield (1:1:1:1 to be updated later). You can compete in rankings with points earned through the game.<br><br>4. Ranking<br> - The ranking is selected using the multi-ranking ranking and the time attack when each boss is cleared. Raise your ranking by clearing many multiplayer and strategic bosses.<br><br>5. Shop<br> - You can draw FRIENDS set skins, individual skins, and skins, and you can purchase items necessary for in-game.<br> - Skins will be added through updates.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361340/extras/70485cec3f4c17653faaa5d31dc7e2ca.avif?t=1682388219\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Friends World is a single and multiplayer strategy defense game made for VR.<br>Friends World is a game created using Kakao Friends' IP. You can experience everything in virtual reality, including various characters, game battles, and various stages and backgrounds.<br><br>Save the 'FRIENDS' who are stained with evil! Rescue the hero stained with evil, rescue the hero, and use that hero to attack all stages!<br><br>1. Deck Setting<br> - Users can create a deck by selecting 'FRIENDS' characters. You can challenge single and multiplayer using your own deck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361340/extras/de75804c354c3e4b2993e08ddc4850ac.avif?t=1682388219\" /></span><br><br>2. Single game<br> - 20 different stages are available. There are 4 bosses in 20 stages, and we plan to continuously add stages through future updates.<br> - You can play a mini-game by throwing gifts and coins before selecting a stage. Gifts can acquire items with a low probability, and coins can acquire CON.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361340/extras/6de5d27fe9727e39f2454a325552a35a.avif?t=1682388219\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361340/extras/2f57dd49da4486641f45ef4915cb2d99.avif?t=1682388219\" /></span><br><br>3. Multi game<br> - You can play invite friends, random 1:1, and Battlefield (1:1:1:1 to be updated later). You can compete in rankings with points earned through the game.<br><br>4. Ranking<br> - The ranking is selected using the multi-ranking ranking and the time attack when each boss is cleared. Raise your ranking by clearing many multiplayer and strategic bosses.<br><br>5. Shop<br> - You can draw FRIENDS set skins, individual skins, and skins, and you can purchase items necessary for in-game.<br> - Skins will be added through updates.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361340/extras/70485cec3f4c17653faaa5d31dc7e2ca.avif?t=1682388219\" /></span>",
